# Only the frontend images (auth/web, web/src/web) are built from the repository root, so only the pnpm workspace
# is sent to Docker.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!packages/ui
!auth/web
!web/src/web

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.tanstack
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.claude
**/.env*
